se,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["那是一张手稿纸，平静地摆放在生态箱旁。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"48":{"step":[[48,49,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["它被雪水打湿后又被烘干，颜色略微发灰，与雪白的花朵相对，如同一层灰暗的影子。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"49":{"step":[[49,50,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["X与女孩将它拾起，人们这才看见它的存在。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"50":{"step":[[50,51,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_atcg/1_5/1_5_at_caizhaixueronghua.jpg","choice":[]},"51":{"step":[[51,52,""]],"type":1,"name":["爱兹拉","","Ezra","","","","",""],"head_icon":"307401.png","audio":"610011950","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“雪峰火绒草，也称雪绒花，菊科火绒草属植物。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"52":{"step":[[52,53,""]],"type":1,"name":["爱兹拉","","Ezra","","","","",""],"head_icon":"307401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“与其他火绒草不同，普遍生长于海拔3000米至3800米的高原与山脉地区。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"53":{"step":[[53,54,""]],"type":1,"name":["爱兹拉","","Ezra","","","","",""],"head_icon":"307401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“它具有燃烧性，是很好的引火材料，因此被称为火绒草。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"54":{"step":[[54,55,""]],"type":1,"name":["爱兹拉","","Ezra","","","","",""],"head_icon":"307401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“与此同时，如同雪花一般的白色，又为其斩获了雪绒花的称号。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"55":{"step":[[55,56,""]],"type":1,"name":["爱兹拉","","Ezra","","","","",""],"head_icon":"307401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“我的母亲带我认识了这种花朵，她告诉我，在我的家乡，这种花寓意着：和平、稳定、真正的相互理解。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"56":{"step":[[56,57,""]],"type":1,"name":["爱兹拉","","Ezra","","","","",""],"head_icon":"307401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“在雪域地区的历史中，他们认为这种花朵来自于一个理想的、无人所知、无人可见的国度。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"57":{"step":[[57,58,""]],"type":1,"name":["爱兹拉","","Ezra","","","","",""],"head_icon":"307401.png","audio":"610011946","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“在那个国度中，没有纷争，人与人相爱，相互平等，相互尊敬。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"58":{"step":[[58,59,""]],"type":1,"name":["爱兹拉","","Ezra","","","","",""],"head_icon":"307401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“而雪绒花，是那国的使者，从窗沿的缝隙走入我们的世界。生长着雪绒花之处，便是与理想之国接壤的土地。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"59":{"step":[[59,60,""]],"type":1,"name":["爱兹拉","","Ezra","","","","",""],"head_icon":"307401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“我们无从得知传说的起源，更无法验明那‘无人所知、无人可见的国度’是否存在。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"60":{"step":[[60,61,""]],"type":1,"name":["爱兹拉","","Ezra","","","","",""],"head_icon":"307401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“但毫无疑问，雪绒花之上寄托着人们对于和平、相互理解、相爱与相互尊敬的诚挚期待。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"61":{"step":[[61,62,""]],"type":1,"name":["爱兹拉","","Ezra","","","","",""],"head_icon":"307401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“而这，也是这场展览真正的主题。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"62":{"step":[[62,63,""]],"type":1,"name":["爱兹拉","","Ezra","","","","",""],"head_icon":"307401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“有双眼的人，都可看见花的美丽；有双手的人，都可接触枝叶的绿意。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"63":{"step":[[63,64,""]],"type":1,"name":["爱兹拉","","Ezra","","","","",""],"head_icon":"307401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“有血液流淌的人，都可行走；有心脏跳动的人，都可相互爱戴。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"64":{"step":[[64,65,""]],"type":1,"name":["爱兹拉","","Ezra","","","","",""],"head_icon":"307411.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“从今天开始，从此时开始。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"65":{"step":[[65,66,""]],"type":1,"name":["爱兹拉","","Ezra","","","","",""],"head_icon":"307411.png","audio":"610011947","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“理想的国，将接壤雪山之下的土壤，火绒草引领的星火，燃燃不熄灭。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"66":{"step":[[66,67,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"67":{"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/heiping.jpg","choice":[]},"info":{"title":"【1.5】爱兹拉玩法剧情07","start":1}}